WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:02.760
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:08.480
Today I am going to explain a comedy horror
film called “Mom and Dad.”

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:09.480
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:15.519
Watch out and take care!

00:00:15.519 --> 00:00:18.880
A family of four lives in a suburban American
town.

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:24.140
The parents, Brent and Kendall love their
kids but hate how their lives have changed

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:25.439
after having them.

00:00:25.439 --> 00:00:31.230
Their youngest son, Josh is seven years old
while their eldest Carly is a teenager.

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:35.840
At the beginning of the movie, Carly is talking
to her boyfriend Demon on the phone.

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:40.090
Her parents do not like the guy, but Carly
of course doesn’t care.

00:00:40.090 --> 00:00:44.510
She and Damon plan to meet later in the evening
when Damon is done with his final test at

00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:45.510
school.

00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:50.120
At breakfast, their housekeeper, Sunyi, listens
to the news about a mother leaving her infant

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:52.070
to die in a car accident.

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:56.870
Sunyi has brought her daughter Lisa to work
and they plan to leave after cleaning the

00:00:56.870 --> 00:00:57.870
house.

00:00:57.870 --> 00:01:01.070
The family is also expecting to see Brent’s
parents for dinner at night.

00:01:01.070 --> 00:01:05.000
Carly wants to cancel the dinner to go out
with Damon which causes an argument between

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:06.480
her and Kendall.

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:11.330
Unknown to her mother, Carly has stolen hundred
dollars from her purse to hang out with her

00:01:11.330 --> 00:01:12.960
best friend Riley.

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:17.180
Kendall drives her to school and they get
into yet another argument on the way.

00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:21.930
Carly harshly tells Kendall that her life
is boring before getting out of the car.

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:25.240
Back at home, Josh playfully hits Brent with
his toy ball.

00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:29.549
Brent looks at his son with murders in his
eyes but laughs it off.

00:01:29.549 --> 00:01:33.229
However, we see him kick Josh’s toy car
before leaving.

00:01:33.229 --> 00:01:38.360
The housekeeper Sunyi is pounding some chicken
while her daughter Lisa watches Josh play

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:39.620
in the background.

00:01:39.620 --> 00:01:45.869
All of a sudden, Josh turns around to Sunyi
hitting her daughter with the Mallet.

00:01:45.869 --> 00:01:49.190
Meanwhile, Kendall is out with her friend
and Riley’s mother, Jeanne.

00:01:49.190 --> 00:01:52.409
They talk about Kendall’s sister Jenna who
is pregnant.

00:01:52.409 --> 00:01:55.780
As Kendall goes through her purse, she notices
that her money is missing.

00:01:55.780 --> 00:02:00.310
Jeanne claims that her daughter always steals
from her, hinting that Carly probably did

00:02:00.310 --> 00:02:01.409
the same.

00:02:01.409 --> 00:02:05.350
Carly is in her classroom when the teacher
gets a call asking him to send a kid to the

00:02:05.350 --> 00:02:06.549
principal’s office.

00:02:06.549 --> 00:02:11.569
Soon, he starts to get several calls and the
school is surrounded by cop cars.

00:02:11.569 --> 00:02:15.610
Not thinking much of it, Carly and her best
friend Riley go to the washroom where Riley

00:02:15.610 --> 00:02:18.030
complains about her mother being a bitch.

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:23.480
They buy some edible pills from a girl and
step out to see the school in complete chaos.

00:02:23.480 --> 00:02:27.290
All the students are running around while
the teachers are nowhere to be seen.

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:32.120
They join the crowd and see a classmate’s
mother trying to cross the school’s fence.

00:02:32.120 --> 00:02:36.510
Outside the school, a large crowd of parents
has gathered wanting to enter the premises

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:39.650
but the police and the security are holding
them back.

00:02:39.650 --> 00:02:44.370
Not knowing what to do, one kid runs to his
mother who brutally stabs him with her car

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:45.370
keys.

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:49.880
The crowd goes wild as more parents start
to beat their kids brutally.

00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:55.550
Some even kill them in the open.

00:02:55.550 --> 00:02:59.709
Carly and Riley manage to get away from the
crowd and get inside Riley’s car.

00:02:59.709 --> 00:03:02.890
Confused by what is going on, they drive to
Riley’s house.

00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:06.650
Meanwhile, Carly’s boyfriend Damon is in
the examination hall.

00:03:06.650 --> 00:03:10.599
There is still an hour left for the test to
be done but the parents of the students gather

00:03:10.599 --> 00:03:12.660
outside waiting for them.

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:15.860
The invigilator thinks it’s weird but dismisses
the matter.

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:19.140
Damon gets done before everyone else and leaves
the hall.

00:03:19.140 --> 00:03:22.250
Behind him, the parents run inside to meet
their kids.

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:25.580
Damon calls Carly telling her that the test
went great.

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:29.590
When he reaches home, he finds his father
drunk sitting on the sofa.

00:03:29.590 --> 00:03:33.420
Not thinking much of it, Damon starts to clean
up the mess in the kitchen when his father

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:35.160
slaps him out of the blue.

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:40.090
At first, Damon dismisses it because he is
drunk but things get heated when his father

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:42.800
attacks him with a broken glass bottle.

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:47.140
As the two struggle, his father falls to the
ground and accidentally stabs his throat,

00:03:47.140 --> 00:03:48.140
and dies.

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:53.379
At the same time, Kendall is in her car reminiscing
about her failed meeting with an ex-employer.

00:03:53.379 --> 00:03:57.800
The man tells her that she has two kids and
has been out of work for over fifteen years

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:00.400
so they cannot let her in that easily.

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:04.290
Seeing what her life has come to, Kendall
starts to have a mental breakdown.

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:08.659
As she sobs, she gets a call informing her
that Jenna has gone into labor.

00:04:08.659 --> 00:04:13.090
Kendall rushes to the hospital and sees a
crowd watching the news about parents killing

00:04:13.090 --> 00:04:14.680
their children.

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:17.630
Before she can listen to it, she is called
by her sister.

00:04:17.630 --> 00:04:20.150
Jenna gives birth to a healthy baby girl.

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:24.949
He holds her baby in her arms but the beautiful
moment turns dark when she starts to strangle

00:04:24.949 --> 00:04:27.310
the baby and has to be restrained.

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:31.729
She even gets her hands on a pair of scissors
and tries to harm her daughter but Kendall

00:04:31.729 --> 00:04:35.070
snatches the baby out of her grip and brings
her outside.

00:04:35.070 --> 00:04:38.370
She cries hysterically asking the nurse what
is going on.

00:04:38.370 --> 00:04:43.400
The nurse takes the baby to a safe zone, claiming
that all the parents have gone crazy.

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:48.150
Outside the neonatal ward, the fathers stare
at their newborns ready to attack them.

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:50.669
Carly and Riley finally reach Riley’s home.

00:04:50.669 --> 00:04:53.430
Carly watches the news while Riley goes upstairs.

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:58.260
The news talks about a mysterious virus that
has spread across America that makes the parents

00:04:58.260 --> 00:05:00.300
want to kill their children.

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:04.020
Carly starts to freak out and goes upstairs
looking for her friend.

00:05:04.020 --> 00:05:08.610
To her horror, she comes across Riley being
strangled to death by her mother.

00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:13.220
She panics and runs away from the house only
to come across a man with a bloodied baseball

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:14.220
bat.

00:05:14.220 --> 00:05:18.580
Damon finds her in the streets and tells her
that she should stay away from her parents.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:21.750
The couple then goes to Carly’s home to
look for Josh.

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:24.850
In the meantime, Brent is at his office taking
a nap.

00:05:24.850 --> 00:05:28.430
He wakes up and asks his assistant to not
take calls from anyone.

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:33.300
Then, he looks at a picture of his kids and
screams, indicating that he also has been

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:38.240
infected by the virus.

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:42.460
Damon and Carly reach home and see that the
housekeeper Sunyi is still there.

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:45.420
They carefully walk inside and ask her where
Josh is.

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:48.170
The woman calmly replies that he is in his
room.

00:05:48.170 --> 00:05:52.850
The couple gets a look at Sunyi’s mop that
is covered in blood and realizes something

00:05:52.850 --> 00:05:54.700
terrible has happened.

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:58.449
Carly runs to get her brother while Damon
keeps an eye on the housekeeper.

00:05:58.449 --> 00:06:01.710
Carly finds a terrified Josh under his bed
crying.

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:05.710
He claims that Sunyi did something really
bad to her daughter but doesn’t explain

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:06.710
what.

00:06:06.710 --> 00:06:11.490
Sunyi drives away after cleaning the mess
but an infected Brent arrives right after.

00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:14.300
He enters the house and sees Damon in the
kitchen.

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:18.190
As he orders him to get out of his house,
Josh hears him and gets out from under the

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:19.190
bed.

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:23.250
Carly asks him to run out quickly but Josh
insists on getting his backpack.

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:27.880
Brent is about to attack Damon but Josh calling
his name grabs his attention.

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:31.090
After seeing his kid, Bernt loses control
and attacks them.

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:35.580
Damon tries to save them but Brent knocks
him unconscious with a single punch to the

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:36.699
throat.

00:06:36.699 --> 00:06:41.050
Following that, he trips on Josh’s toy car
giving Carly and Josh an opportunity to run

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:43.710
down to the basement and lock themselves.

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:47.610
They run down the stairs and see that everything
in the basement is destroyed.

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:52.259
Three weeks prior to the incident, Brent had
brought a pool table and built it in the basement

00:06:52.259 --> 00:06:54.100
to turn it into a mancave.

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:58.470
He is pretty satisfied with his job until
Kendall sees the purchase and asks him how

00:06:58.470 --> 00:07:00.030
much it cost.

00:07:00.030 --> 00:07:04.030
Brent starts to yell at her saying that he
deserves to spoil himself a little bit because

00:07:04.030 --> 00:07:05.050
he works hard.

00:07:05.050 --> 00:07:09.850
As the two get into a fight, he brings out
a hammer and maniacally breaks everything

00:07:09.850 --> 00:07:11.130
he just built.

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:15.910
He says that he wants to feel like his younger
and carefree self again but knows that is

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:17.360
not possible.

00:07:17.360 --> 00:07:21.910
Kendall agrees, claiming that she sacrificed
her dreams and aspirations for her family

00:07:21.910 --> 00:07:25.850
and although she loves everyone, she misses
her old self.

00:07:25.850 --> 00:07:33.890
Back in the present, Kendall drives back home
while hoping her kids are okay.

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:38.190
She listens to the radio where the host warns
the parents to stay away from their kids because

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:40.970
one never knows when they might get infected.

00:07:40.970 --> 00:07:45.720
Kendall quickly stops her car but it is too
late because she is already infected and has

00:07:45.720 --> 00:07:47.230
reached her home.

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:49.460
She enters the house and joins Brent.

00:07:49.460 --> 00:07:52.710
They bang on the basement door and ask the
kids to come out.

00:07:52.710 --> 00:07:56.730
Kendall brings out an electric saw and tries
to break down the door.

00:07:56.730 --> 00:08:01.160
At the same time, Brent goes to the other
room to get his gun but finds the gun case

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:02.380
empty.

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:06.289
Little Josh shoots his mother through the
door and the bullet hits her shoulder.

00:08:06.289 --> 00:08:11.130
It turns out that Josh has stolen Brent’s
gun and kept it in his backpack a while ago.

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:14.420
Kendall makes her husband pour alcohol on
her wound.

00:08:14.420 --> 00:08:18.099
Inside the basement, the kids hear their mother
scream in pain and cry.

00:08:18.099 --> 00:08:23.290
Now, Kendall and Brent cannot enter the basement
forcefully with the fear of being shot.

00:08:23.290 --> 00:08:27.490
Brent thinks of another way and attaches the
LPG pipe to the basement.

00:08:27.490 --> 00:08:31.800
This way, they plan to gas the kids until
they pass out and attack them at the right

00:08:31.800 --> 00:08:32.800
moment.

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:37.009
Kendall sticks tapes to cover the holes she
just created in the door so the gas wouldn’t

00:08:37.009 --> 00:08:38.009
leak.

00:08:38.009 --> 00:08:42.110
Carly notices this and pokes her fingers out
to investigate only to be attacked by her

00:08:42.110 --> 00:08:43.339
mother again.

00:08:43.339 --> 00:08:47.509
As the gas begins to fill up the basement,
Carly realizes what her parents are trying

00:08:47.509 --> 00:08:48.509
to do.

00:08:48.509 --> 00:08:53.339
A long time passes and Kendall and Brant patiently
wait for their kids to give up.

00:08:53.339 --> 00:08:57.170
When they begin to cough because of the gas,
Carly devises a plan.

00:08:57.170 --> 00:09:00.959
She finds a matchbox and carefully tears off
the box’s strip.

00:09:00.959 --> 00:09:04.890
She then attaches it to the bottom of the
door along with some matchsticks.

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:09.300
This way, when the door opens, the matches
will light on fire causing an explosion because

00:09:09.300 --> 00:09:10.300
of the gas.

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:15.040
Then, She and Josh get into a vent and crawl
their way out of the basement.

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:19.480
The parents realize that the kids have gone
silent, so they create a hole in the door

00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:21.100
and look for them.

00:09:21.100 --> 00:09:24.189
Following that, they open the door causing
an explosion.

00:09:24.189 --> 00:09:29.110
Brent is gravely hurt but Kendall survives
and finds the kids in the hallways.

00:09:29.110 --> 00:09:33.300
As she tries to kill them, they are saved
by Damon who happens to be alive.

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:38.069
He and Carly restrain Kendall and lock her
inside the closet but she manages to pierce

00:09:38.069 --> 00:09:41.009
Damon’s cheeks with a hanger and breaks
free.

00:09:41.009 --> 00:09:46.209
As the struggle continues, Kendall smacks
him with a mallet and pushes him off the railing.

00:09:46.209 --> 00:09:48.420
Following that, Brant gains consciousness.

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:51.199
He and Kendall walk up to their kids to kill
them.

00:09:51.199 --> 00:09:56.329
But before they can, the doorbell rings indicating
that Brent’s parents are here.

00:09:56.329 --> 00:09:59.139
He opens the door for them but is immediately
attacked.

00:09:59.139 --> 00:10:04.329
A chase ensues in the house, in which Brent
is chased by his father while he chases Josh.

00:10:04.329 --> 00:10:08.459
At last, Brent and his father end up wrestling
inside a car.

00:10:08.459 --> 00:10:12.749
Back in the kitchen, Kendall tries to persuade
Brent’s mother to not kill him, when she

00:10:12.749 --> 00:10:16.259
doesn’t agree on doing so, she smacks the
old lady with the mallet.

00:10:16.259 --> 00:10:19.299
She then moves to Carly and chases her outside.

00:10:19.299 --> 00:10:21.389
The grandmother also follows them behind.

00:10:21.389 --> 00:10:25.639
All of a sudden, the car that Brent is in
hits the grandmother, killing her.

00:10:25.639 --> 00:10:30.369
The grandfather is thrown outside because
of the impact and is also killed instantly.

00:10:30.369 --> 00:10:33.959
Brent, on the other hand, passes out because
of the crash.

00:10:33.959 --> 00:10:38.819
As the others watch the scene, Damon, who
is still alive knocks Kendall out.

00:10:38.819 --> 00:10:43.110
In the following scene, the parents are tied
in the basement while the kids watch them.

00:10:43.110 --> 00:10:47.360
They try to fake being normal so the kids
would set them free but the trick doesn’t

00:10:47.360 --> 00:10:48.360
work.

00:10:48.360 --> 00:10:50.500
Josh tells his parents that he still loves
them.

00:10:50.500 --> 00:11:02.180
The movie ends as Brent says he loves him
too, but sometimes he just wants to kill them.

